    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "simplified": "本：我今天去商店买东西，那个店员叫我“去死”！",
      "traditional": "本：我今天去商店買東西，那個店員叫我“去死”！",
      "pinyin": "běn wǒ jīn tiān qù shāng diàn mǎi dōng xi nà ge diàn yuán jiào wǒ qù sǐ",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Ben: I went to a store to buy something today, and that shop assistant told me to “go die”!"
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "simplified": "小雨：啊？",
      "traditional": "小雨：啊？",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo yǔ a",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little Yu: Ah?"
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "simplified": "本：我买了东西，在我给店员钱的时候，她问我“你要godie吗”！\n",
      "traditional": "本：我買了東西，在我給店員錢的時候，她問我“你要godie嗎”！\n",
      "pinyin": "běn wǒ mǎi le dōng xi zài wǒ gěi diàn yuán qián de shí hou tā wèn wǒ nǐ yào 1 1 ma",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "simplified": "小雨：她说“godie”？",
      "traditional": "小雨：她說“godie”？",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo yǔ tā shuō 1 1",
      "english": "Ben: I was buying things, and when I gave the shop assistant money, she asked me “Will you go die”!"
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little Yu: She said “go die”?"
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "simplified": "本：对啊！你说，她为什么要说英语？",
      "traditional": "本：對啊！你說，她為什麼要說英語？",
      "pinyin": "běn duì a nǐ shuō tā wèi shén me yào shuō yīng yǔ",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "simplified": "她为什么要问我“你要去死吗”？我又不想去死。",
      "traditional": "她為什麼要問我“你要去死嗎”？我又不想去死。",
      "pinyin": "tā wèi shén me yào wèn wǒ nǐ yào qù sǐ ma wǒ yòu bù xiǎng qù sǐ",
      "english": "Ben: That’s right! You tell me, why did she speak English?"
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Why did she ask me “Will you go die”? I also don’t want to go and die."
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "simplified": "小雨：本！她是在问你“你要购物袋吗”？是“购物袋”，不是“godie”。",
      "traditional": "小雨：本！她是在問你“你要購物袋嗎”？是“購物袋”，不是“godie”。",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo yǔ běn tā shì zài wèn nǐ nǐ yào gòu wù dài ma shì gòu wù dài bú shì 1 1",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little Yu: Ben! She was asking you “Do you want a shopping bag?” It’s “shopping bag”, not “go die”."
    },
